    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d87">

                <pb facs="0789" n="639" xml:id="pg639"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 6775/62.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to Ambassador
                        Thompson.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1907-08-28"><hi rendition="#italic">August 28,
                        1907</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>After conferring with President Diaz, President Roosevelt to-day addressed a
                    personal message to each Central American president, of which I send you text
                    for your information.<anchor n="a" xml:id="d87-f1"/></p>
                <p>It has been agreed that President Diaz shall send a telegram in similar
                    sense.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Adee.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
